{"2509440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nightborn", "steam_appid": 2509440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4836800], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightborn is a Vampire RPG with narrative-focused gameplay set in a twisted gothic version of our world.<br><br>Players assume the role of the Bloodhound, a Vampire detective trained in tracking supernatural threats to the Nightborn, using arcane rituals forbidden to others of your kind.<br><br>Investigate the mysterious disappearance of your Maker, a politically influential member of the Nightborn, the Vampire elite of New Orleans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lycans, Horrors, and Cryptids, Oh My!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many mysteries to fear in the dark gothic world of Nightborn. Creatures beyond comprehension to discover, catalog, and, if you are skilled enough, survive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supernatural power courses through your undead veins. Summon dark energies or boost your abilities beyond what mortals dream possible. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominate your Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush all who oppose you with fists, claws, melee weapons, or firearms! Or, optionally, show mercy. But where is the fun in that?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Dialogue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what you say carefully. You may insult or befriend NPCs based on what you say. Gather information and keep your secrets close to your chest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth is an excellent tool affording your Nightborn the ability to get the drop on Vampire Hunters or Supernatural foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Thirst</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeding is required to sustain your undead form. Thankfully, Vampire Hunters are always making personal deliveries, with fresh &quot;donations&quot;!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gothic Night Clubs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with your lost humanity by engaging in mortal activities. Public areas provide many feeding opportunities for the subtle and seductive. <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own Bloodhound character, choosing from 10 iconic Vampire lineages with a set of signature lineage power skill trees. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lineage powers include physical prowess enhancements, shapeshifting, controlling the minds of mortals, and acts of eldritch sorcery. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel Vampire powers by preying upon mortals via stealth, seduction, or brute force. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elude Mortal Law Enforcement and Monster Hunters, masking your dark nature.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mysteries of gothic New Orleans by taking quests, discovering clues, and exploring the supernatural underworld. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle, evade, or outwit, natural and supernatural foes, using your powers, weapons, and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side with a Nightborn faction, the ruling Establishment, the reckless Libertines, or the fanatical Orthodoxy; or eschew them all to forge your own path. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightborn is a Vampire RPG with narrative-focused gameplay set in a twisted gothic version of our world.<br><br>Players assume the role of the Bloodhound, a Vampire detective trained in tracking supernatural threats to the Nightborn, using arcane rituals forbidden to others of your kind.<br><br>Investigate the mysterious disappearance of your Maker, a politically influential member of the Nightborn, the Vampire elite of New Orleans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lycans, Horrors, and Cryptids, Oh My!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many mysteries to fear in the dark gothic world of Nightborn. Creatures beyond comprehension to discover, catalog, and, if you are skilled enough, survive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supernatural power courses through your undead veins. Summon dark energies or boost your abilities beyond what mortals dream possible. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominate your Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush all who oppose you with fists, claws, melee weapons, or firearms! Or, optionally, show mercy. But where is the fun in that?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Dialogue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what you say carefully. You may insult or befriend NPCs based on what you say. Gather information and keep your secrets close to your chest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth is an excellent tool affording your Nightborn the ability to get the drop on Vampire Hunters or Supernatural foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Thirst</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeding is required to sustain your undead form. Thankfully, Vampire Hunters are always making personal deliveries, with fresh &quot;donations&quot;!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gothic Night Clubs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.poster.avif?t=1782516765\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.webm?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.mp4?t=1782516765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with your lost humanity by engaging in mortal activities. Public areas provide many feeding opportunities for the subtle and seductive. <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own Bloodhound character, choosing from 10 iconic Vampire lineages with a set of signature lineage power skill trees. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lineage powers include physical prowess enhancements, shapeshifting, controlling the minds of mortals, and acts of eldritch sorcery. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel Vampire powers by preying upon mortals via stealth, seduction, or brute force. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elude Mortal Law Enforcement and Monster Hunters, masking your dark nature.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mysteries of gothic New Orleans by taking quests, discovering clues, and exploring the supernatural underworld. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle, evade, or outwit, natural and supernatural foes, using your powers, weapons, and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side with a Nightborn faction, the ruling Establishment, the reckless Libertines, or the fanatical Orthodoxy; or eschew them all to forge your own path. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Fight, sneak, or charm your way through a gothic modern New Orleans as a Vampire detective of your creation. Unravel a vast centuries-old conspiracy involving Vampire factions, Werewolves, and far stranger horrors. Try to survive as a Nightborn without losing yourself to madness or damnation.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Czech, Portuguese - Portugal<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/8e32dc10e03264b2bd0d31402003579b69ac2e22/header.jpg?t=1782516765", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/a2d83358e2af9c4ed2450a4386ce93d601e68e4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782516765", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/a2d83358e2af9c4ed2450a4386ce93d601e68e4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782516765", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit version 1909 revision .1350 or higher, or versions 2004 and 20H2 revision .789 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 70 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> HDD Supported, SSD Recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700 / AMD Ryzen 5 5500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 / AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT / INTEL Arc A750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></l